{
  "id": "arnhem-1944-bridge",
  "name": "Arnhem bridge, 17–18 September 1944 (provisional)",
  "dataStatus": "provisional",
  "description": "From 15:00 on 17 September to 21:00 on 18 September 1944 (Allied \"A\" time, GMT+1). The first lift of the 1st British Airborne Division has landed west of Arnhem, 10 km from the road bridge, and its battalions are moving off from their rendezvous. The Allied side must take the bridge and link up with it: hold its north end and the St Elisabeth Hospital, the way in from the west, for four turn ends in a row with a supplied unit, or hold both ends of the bridge for two. The German side, gathering from every direction, must stop them by the end.",
  "start": {
    "day": 17,
    "minuteOfDay": 900,
    "date": "1944-09-17",
    "utcOffsetMinutes": 60
  },
